sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Seq as Merge Sequencer
    participant Git as Git Remote (main)
    participant AgentA as Slot 1 Agent Sandbox<br/>(Branch A)
    participant CovA as Coverity Engine<br/>(Slot 1 idir)
    participant AgentB as Slot 2 Agent Sandbox<br/>(Branch B: Dual-Track)
    participant CovB as Coverity Engine<br/>(Slot 2 idirs)

    Note over Seq,Git: 1. Pre-Sequencing & Dual-Track Dispatch
    Seq->>Git: Read current HEAD (SHA_0)
    Seq->>AgentA: Assign Slot 1 (Base: SHA_0)
    Seq->>AgentB: Assign Slot 2 (Optimistic: SHA_0+A | Fallback: SHA_0)

    par Slot 1 Execution
        AgentA->>Git: git rebase SHA_0
        AgentA->>CovA: cov-build & cov-analyze --dir idir_A
        alt Coverity Finds Defect
            CovA-->>AgentA: Export defects.sarif + persist idir_A
            loop Developer-Owned Inner Loop
                AgentA->>AgentA: Patch defect using SARIF trace
                AgentA->>CovA: Incremental cov-build & cov-analyze --dir idir_A
            end
        end
        CovA-->>AgentA: Clean Pass (0 new defects)
        AgentA->>AgentA: Sign Attestation(TreeSHA_A, Parent: SHA_0)
    and Slot 2 Parallel Branch Prediction
        par Track 1 (Optimistic: main + A + B)
            AgentB->>AgentB: git rebase (SHA_0 + A)
            AgentB->>CovB: cov-build & cov-analyze --dir idir_B_opt
            opt Integration Defect Found
                CovB-->>AgentB: Export opt_defects.sarif
                AgentB->>AgentB: Patch integration bug (with Branch A diff context)
                AgentB->>CovB: Incremental cov-analyze --dir idir_B_opt
            end
            CovB-->>AgentB: Clean Pass
            AgentB->>AgentB: Sign Attestation(TreeSHA_B_opt, Parent: SHA_0+A)
        and Track 2 (Fallback: main + B)
            AgentB->>AgentB: git rebase SHA_0
            AgentB->>CovB: cov-build & cov-analyze --dir idir_B_fall
            opt Isolated Defect Found
                CovB-->>AgentB: Export fall_defects.sarif
                AgentB->>AgentB: Patch isolated bug
                AgentB->>CovB: Incremental cov-analyze --dir idir_B_fall
            end
            CovB-->>AgentB: Clean Pass
            AgentB->>AgentB: Sign Attestation(TreeSHA_B_fall, Parent: SHA_0)
        end
    end

    Note over Seq,Git: 2. Fast-Forward Admission & Outcome Selection
    alt Slot 1 Passes Within Budget
        AgentA->>Git: git push --ff-only main (Commit A + Attestation_A)
        Git->>Git: Verify Parent == SHA_0 & Attestation Signature
        Git-->>AgentA: Fast-Forward Accepted (New HEAD: SHA_1)
        Git-->>AgentB: Event: main updated to SHA_1
        AgentB->>AgentB: Discard Track 2 (idir_B_fall)
        AgentB->>Git: git push --ff-only main (Commit B_opt + Attestation_B_opt)
        Git->>Git: Verify Parent == SHA_1 & Attestation Signature
        Git-->>AgentB: Fast-Forward Accepted (New HEAD: SHA_2)
    else Slot 1 Evicted / Timed Out
        AgentA-->>Seq: Report Eviction (main remains SHA_0)
        Seq-->>AgentB: Event: Slot 1 Evicted (HEAD still SHA_0)
        AgentB->>AgentB: Discard Track 1 (idir_B_opt)
        AgentB->>Git: git push --ff-only main (Commit B_fall + Attestation_B_fall)
        Git->>Git: Verify Parent == SHA_0 & Attestation Signature
        Git-->>AgentB: Fast-Forward Accepted (New HEAD: SHA_1)
    end
